WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900
Blueair finished third
in all four AI rankings.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.780
Then one assistant left it out
of the budget answer.

3
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:10.040
ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity
ranked Coway first.

4
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.720
Claude picked Levoit.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.300
All four put Blueair in the same spot.

6
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.940
Across discovery, budget and ranking,

7
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.680
Coway and Levoit appeared
in every answer.

8
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.080
Blueair appeared in 11 of 12.

9
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.300
The one miss was Claude’s
under-$300 prompt.

10
00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:28.900
Last week, the same four assistants
placed Blueair fourth.

11
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.060
That’s a change between two snapshots
of captured answers.

12
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.660
For a brand team,
track where you rank

13
00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:37.000
and whether you show up
when the shopper adds a constraint.

14
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:39.780
We captured these answers
November 25.

15
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.980
They don’t establish product quality
or verify prices.

16
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:45.980
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
